section
  Initial Inline Elements

The following inline elements are part of the initial LDL specification.

list
  params
    type: unordered

  body
    ---
    *text* — Strong emphasis
    /text/ — Emphasis
    +text+ — Underlined text
    --text-- — Strikethrough text
    \_\_path "/path/to/file" — Filesystem path
    \_\_url "https://example.org" — URL
    \_\_keys "Ctrl+C" — Keyboard shortcut
    \_\_cmd "uv run pytest" — Command line
    \_\_code "printf()" — Inline source code
    ---
